[statement]
The walk that orders provided names is depth-first: `q`, needed by `p1`, a
candidate for `v`, is decided before `u`, which `app` lists after `v`. Its
one provider `r2` provides `u` too, so `r1`, of higher priority for `u`, is
not installed.

[repository]
P:app
V:1
D:v u

P:p1
V:1
p:v
k:100
D:q

P:p2
V:1
p:v
k:10

P:r1
V:1
p:u
k:100

P:r2
V:1
p:u q=1
k:10

[request]
app

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install r2 1
install p1 1
install app 1
